            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#c2ef4e] micro-pulse"></span>
            <span class="uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Turma Alpha Fundadora</span>
          </div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[#c2ef4e] border border-[#c2ef4e]/30 bg-[#c2ef4e]/10 font-bold">
            15 Vagas Restritas
          </span>
        </div>

        <!-- Preço com Âncora Canônica -->
        <div class="py-8 text-center">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#cfcfdb] uppercase tracking-wider">Preço Regular Futuro:</span>
            <span class="text-sm font-mono line-through text-[#ffb287] font-semibold">R$ 297/mês</span>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs font-mono text-[#c2ef4e] uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 font-bold">Preço Travado para Membros Alpha</p>
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-center gap-2">
            <span class="font-sans font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#ffffff]">R$</span>
            <span class="font-sans font-black text-6xl sm:text-7xl md:text-8xl text-gradient-lime leading-none select-none tracking-tighter">197</span>
            <span class="text-[#cfcfdb] text-sm font-mono">/mês</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono text-[#cfcfdb] mt-2">
            Pagamento via Pix manual direto · Sem fidelidade · Cancele quando quiser
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Inclusões Oficiais (03.6) -->
        <div class="space-y-3.5 pb-8 border-y border-[#3b2c60] text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#cfcfdb]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#c2ef4e]/15 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-[#c2ef4e]">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong class="text-[#ffffff]">3 Sessões Individuais / Semana:</strong> 2x 15m (agilidade) + 1x 30m (Boss Raid) com Gabe.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#c2ef4e]/15 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-[#c2ef4e]">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong class="text-[#ffffff]">LibreChat IA 24/7:</strong> sparring diário de 15 min sem caneta vermelha (Spaced Recasting).</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#c2ef4e]/15 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-[#c2ef4e]">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong class="text-[#ffffff]">Portal do Aluno (Moodle Hub):</strong> gravações das suas sessões, áudios e missões guiadas.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#c2ef4e]/15 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-[#c2ef4e]">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong class="text-[#ffffff]">Diagnóstico CEFR Contínuo:</strong> rastreamento do mapa de 350 a 2.500 chunks.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#c2ef4e]/15 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-[#c2ef4e]">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span><strong class="text-[#ffffff]">Garantia Incondicional 30 Dias:</strong> destrave sua fala ou 100% de reembolso via Pix.</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA Principal: WhatsApp Direto -->
        <div class="pt-8">
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/5511967239791?text=Ol%C3%A1%20Gabe!%20Quero%20garantir%20minha%20vaga%20na%20Turma%20Alpha%20da%20LexiQuest%20por%20R%24%20197%2Fm%C3%AAs!"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-5 rounded-full bg-[#c2ef4e] text-[#1f1633] font-sans font-extrabold text-base hover:bg-[#b0dc41] active:scale-95 transition-all shadow-xl shadow-[#c2ef4e]/20 group"
          >
            <span>Garantir Uma das 15 Vagas Alpha</span>
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>

          <p class="text-center text-xs font-mono text-[#79628c] mt-4">
            Conversa direta no WhatsApp pessoal de Gabriel Lima
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
